{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12232040","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12232040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1223204001:1":{"text":"망할! 분명 돈 얘기는 다 끝냈잖아. 떼어먹을 생각이야?!","source_cn":"混蛋啊！我们谈好的价格，你想赖账吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAF9AF07FF6743FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1223204002:1":{"text":"떼어먹다니? 물귀신파 입에서 그런 소리가 나오는 것도 우습지 않나?","source_cn":"赖账？这句话从你们水鬼帮嘴里说出来真是好笑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA67A079B97BF453C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1223204003:1":{"text":"너희가 제일 잘하는 거잖아. 우리 물건 강도질할 땐 돈을 냈었나 봐?","source_cn":"这不是你们最擅长的吗，抢我们东西的时候，你们付过钱了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DC0FE40ED8276CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1223204004:1":{"text":"입 다물어. 일을 해줬으면 돈을 내라고!","source_cn":"别耍嘴皮子，帮你做了事，你就得付钱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x209F80878FC2C436","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1223204005:1":{"text":"그러려면 네가 훔쳐 갔던 물건값부터 내야지.","source_cn":"行啊，你先付抢的东西的钱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3032853139F6203E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1223204006:1":{"text":"지금 수작 부리는 거야? 본때를 한 번 보여줘?","source_cn":"别耍心眼，想吃点苦头是吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6AADDAF89DF4501","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1223204007:1":{"text":"오, 어디 한 번 쳐봐 그럼! 요즘 다들 너희를 지켜보고 있는 거 알고는 있나 모르겠군.","source_cn":"你们敢动手吗？这段时间，大家都提着一口气盯着你们呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D32488FBC71B745","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1223204008:1":{"text":"만약 진짜 치면 모처럼 쌓아 올린...","source_cn":"你们要是动手，好不容易建立起来的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9D7E928C072FEFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1223204009:0":{"text":"아야, 누구야?!","source_cn":"哎呦，谁打我？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6D22460C7C86A4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1223204010:1":{"text":"햄스터 기사 치피! 아무리 상대가 물귀신이라도 괴롭히게 둘 순 없어요!","source_cn":"仓鼠骑士满满，不允许坏蛋在这里欺负人，即使欺负的是水鬼...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CDE983014B52F09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1223204011:1":{"text":"그래, 친구들 불러왔다 이거지? 내가 무서워할 줄 알고?","source_cn":"好啊！你还叫了人是吧？我怕你们？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF0437F51891181F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1223204012:1":{"text":"얘들아, 덮쳐라!","source_cn":"兄弟们，给我上！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26C79522F4DFAE98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:水鬼帮梭罗":{"text":"솔로","source":"水鬼帮梭罗","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:蛮横的混混":{"text":"건달","source":"蛮横的混混","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":3}}